id: pm-gh1487
title: "GH-1487: Respect nested Git repository boundaries during tracker discovery"
description: Investigate implicit tracker discovery crossing the nearest Git repository boundary and silently mutating an enclosing repository tracker when the nested repository has no tracker. Preserve explicit tracker overrides and intentional workspace policies.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[2]: github-intake,release-closeout
